    "id": "media/upload-mixed",
    "route": "POST /media",
    "about": "Six files in one request: accepted JPEG and static GIF, an animated GIF (stored as video), a text file named .png (rejected by content), a .txt (rejected by extension) and a copy of media 2 (duplicate). Still 201. The animated GIF's width/height/duration come from ffprobe where it is installed; without it, as here, width/height fall back to getimagesize and duration is 0.",
